    When bedrockExplainPatch is called
    Then it resolves to exactly:
      """
      Hi

      <!-- Generated by global.anthropic.claude-opus-5-5-v1:0 @ abc1234 -->
      """

  Scenario: a truncated bedrock response retries with doubled max tokens
    Given the patch tokenizes to 100000 tokens
    And the first bedrock call truncates with text "half a review"
    And the bedrock stream yields text "the full review"
    When bedrockExplainPatch is called
    Then it resolves to exactly:
      """
      the full review

      <!-- Generated by global.anthropic.claude-opus-5-5-v1:0 -->
      """
    And 2 bedrock invocations were made
    And bedrock invocation 1 used max tokens 16384 and temperature 1.0
    And bedrock invocation 2 used max tokens 32768 and temperature 1.0

