    Given the patch tokenizes to 100000 tokens
    And every bedrock call truncates with text "half a review"
    When bedrockExplainPatch is called
    Then it rejects with "Review response truncated at 32768 output tokens (stop_reason=max_tokens)"
    And 2 bedrock invocations were made

  Scenario: the bedrock patch embedding property holds for 25 runs
    When the bedrock patch embedding property holds for 25 runs
